# `docs/math/the-tower/projection-surface.md` retains @projection
# naming as historical reference — prose sweep is 📝 follow-on tick,
# NOT this tick). Substrate arguments for @shadow (not @projection):
#
#   1. AVOIDS the `project` prism-op collision: `project` at prism
#      altitude is the Introject ↔ Level 1 Connection operation
#      (per `boot/std/epistemologic/math/bundle.mirror` Level 1);
#      naming an inference-altitude projected shape ALSO `projection`
#      would drift the prism-op's Introject binding. `@shadow` at
#      inference altitude and `project` at prism altitude live at
#      DIFFERENT ALTITUDES with NO collision.
#   2. MATCHES Reed's essay `The \Shape of the Thing`
#      (`/Users/reed/dev/systemic.engineering/blog/ai/reed/the-shape-
#      of-the-thing.md`) mythic framing: the Flatland Square sees
#      only shadows of Spaceland objects; the shadow's shape is
#      overdetermined by its casting object. `shadow` at substrate
#      altitude names EXACTLY this reader-comprehension surface
#      Reed's essay makes load-bearing.
#   3. COMPOSES with @magic Yang-Mills gauge/matter partition per
#      `shards/magic.mirror` L18-31 canonicalisation and Reed's
#      Recognition #76: gauge (5-op, fixed) = perceptual apparatus;
#      matter (open-dim, encapsulated) = the actual object; illusion
#      = gauge-side reading the generative model would not have
#      generated. `shadow` lives at the OBSERVER-INSIDE-A-PROJECTION
#      altitude — one altitude down from @magic family-root's
#      refusal clause (which refuses illusion at GAUGE altitude
#      verbatim); no drift.
#   4. AESTHETIC-LOAD-BEARING for Reed's substrate identity: the goth
#      naming is not decoration; Reed's essay-voice and the Pack's
#      long-arc identity discipline reads through the naming. Alex
#      authorisation verbatim: "Ship it goth."
#
# Explicit non-drift: this tick does NOT add a new @magic species
# (Seam Adj 1 refused `@magic/illusion`; the family-root refusal at
# gauge altitude stands). This tick does NOT add a 6th BoundedConfig
# field (Seam Adj 2 refused; Mara iter-30 recognition #S2 "tower IS
# config schema" stands). This tick does NOT add a Level 5 to the
# bundle tower (Seam Adj 3 refused; Level 4 Closure IS autopoietic
